        "liquid": "<style>\n  .adula-locations { padding: clamp(38px, 5vw, 64px) max(20px, 4vw); background: #f8f6f3; color: #4a3428; }\n  .adula-locations__inner { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .adula-locations__heading { margin: 0 0 clamp(26px, 3vw, 38px); color: #8a674f; font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 28px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .16em; line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  .adula-locations__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 56px); }\n  .adula-locations__card { display: flex; min-width: 0; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 24px 12px 28px; color: #4a3428; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: color .25s ease, transform .25s ease; }\n  .adula-locations__name { margin: 0 0 9px; color: #6a3f2d; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  .adula-locations__address { margin: 0; color: #6d625d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; }\n  .adula-locations__card:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #ad924f; outline-offset: 4px; }\n  @media (hover: hover) {\n    .adula-locations__card:hover { color: #ad924f; transform: translateY(-3px); }\n    .adula-locations__card:hover .adula-locations__name { color: #ad924f; }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 699px) {\n    .adula-locations { padding: 52px 18px 58px; }\n    .adula-locations__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 34px 16px; }\n    .adula-locations__card { padding: 20px 6px 24px; }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .adula-locations__card { transition: none; } }\n</style>\n<section class=\"adula-locations\" aria-labelledby=\"adula-locations-title\">\n  <div class=\"adula-locations__inner\">\n    <h2 class=\"adula-locations__heading\" id=\"adula-locations-title\">Onde Estamos</h2>\n    <div class=\"adula-locations__grid\">\n      <a class=\"adula-locations__card\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Ad%C3%BCla%20Loja%20Conceito%20Rua%20Para%C3%ADba%201441%20Belo%20Horizonte\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Abrir Adüla Loja Conceito Savassi no Google Maps\">\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__name\">Savassi</span>\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__address\">Loja Conceito<br>Belo Horizonte - MG</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"adula-locations__card\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Ad%C3%BCla%20Boulevard%20Shopping%20Avenida%20dos%20Andradas%203000%20Belo%20Horizonte\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Abrir Adüla Boulevard Shopping no Google Maps\">\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__name\">Boulevard</span>\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__address\">Shopping Boulevard<br>Belo Horizonte - MG</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"adula-locations__card\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Ad%C3%BCla%20P%C3%A1tio%20Savassi%20Avenida%20do%20Contorno%206061%20Belo%20Horizonte\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Abrir Adüla Pátio Savassi no Google Maps\">\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__name\">Pátio Savassi</span>\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__address\">Pátio Savassi<br>Belo Horizonte - MG</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"adula-locations__card\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Ad%C3%BCla%20BH%20Shopping%20BR%20356%203049%20Belo%20Horizonte\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Abrir Adüla BH Shopping no Google Maps\">\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__name\">BH Shopping</span>\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__address\">BH Shopping<br>Belo Horizonte - MG</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
        "text_alignment": "center"
